  "thig7.2:0.1": "",
  "thig7.2:0.2": "",
  "thig7.2:0.3": "Thig 7:2 Cālā ",
  "thig7.2:1.1": "Cālā:\nHaving established mindfulness, ",
  "thig7.2:1.2": "a nun with developed faculties, ",
  "thig7.2:1.3": "I\npenetrated the peaceful state: ",
  "thig7.2:1.4": "stilling-of-fabrications bliss. ",
  "thig7.2:2.1": "Māra:\n“For whose sake\nhave you shaved your head? ",
  "thig7.2:2.2": "You look like a contemplative ",
  "thig7.2:2.3": "but don’t approve of a philosophy, ",
  "thig7.2:2.4": "so why are you wandering here\nconfused?” ",
  "thig7.2:3.1": "Cālā:\n“Outside philosophers place ",
  "thig7.2:3.2": "their confidence in views. ",
  "thig7.2:3.3": "They don’t know the Dhamma. ",
  "thig7.2:3.4": "They’re not adept in the Dhamma. ",
  "thig7.2:4.1": "But there is\nthe Awakened One,\nborn in the Sakyan clan, ",
  "thig7.2:4.2": "a person without peer. ",
  "thig7.2:4.3": "He taught me the Dhamma ",
  "thig7.2:4.4": "for the transcending of views: ",
  "thig7.2:5.1": "stress,\nthe co-arising of stress, ",
  "thig7.2:5.2": "the overcoming of stress, ",
  "thig7.2:5.3": "& the noble eightfold path ",
  "thig7.2:5.4": "leading to the stilling of stress. ",
  "thig7.2:6.1": "Having heard his words, ",
  "thig7.2:6.2": "I dwell, delighting\nin his bidding. ",
  "thig7.2:6.3": "The three knowledges\nare attained; ",
  "thig7.2:6.4": "the Buddha’s bidding,\ndone. ",
  "thig7.2:7.1": "Everywhere enjoyment\nis defeated; ",
  "thig7.2:7.2": "the mass of darkness,\nburst. ",
  "thig7.2:7.3": "So know, Evil One, ",
  "thig7.2:7.4": "that you have been,\nEnd-maker,\nstruck down. ",
  "thig7.2:8.1": ""
}
